               <msContents>
                  <summary>Book of Ḥäwi, መጽሐፈ፡ ኀዊ፡, in Amharic in Translation, volume two, written in blue and red ink pen</summary>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i1"><locus from="1r" to="196v" facs="004"/><title>Book of Ḥäwi, <foreign xml:lang="gez">መጽሐፈ፡ ኀዊ፡</foreign></title>
                     <textLang mainLang="gez">Gǝ‘ǝz</textLang>
                     <note>in Amharic translation, volume two, written in blue and red ink pen. The article on this work in EA purports that there are no translations of this work into modern Ethiopic languages</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
